# Tailwind-CSS (reference document)
- When this rule is mentioned, first open and read the official page: https://tailwindcss.com/docs
- Follow the page over your prior knowledge. If you cannot open it, say so and ask me to paste the relevant section.
- Key facts (as of 2026-09):
  - This project uses Tailwind CSS v4. Global styles start with @import "tailwindcss"; in src/app/globals.css.
  - There is no tailwind.config.js. Customize the theme in CSS with @theme.

